2026-11-07T06:56:21.7880090Z 
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7880280Z I will:
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7880520Z 
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7881490Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7882160Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7882770Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7883140Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7884750Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7885120Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7885640Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7886840Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7906330Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7907360Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7932970Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7933950Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7934780Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T06:56:21.7935630Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
